    """The cards of a company linked with one profile are of one being (customer's decision of
    28.11.2026) — when they are of different roles and of one kind; the rest is joined by hand.
    The data of the cards are left as they are: they become the same at the next change."""
    Party = apps.get_model("parties", "Party")
